      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I was able to actively trigger and reproduce this issue with a friend by repeatedly triggering and canceling a gesture with a sound on my avatar (avtr_5623eda9-811d-44ad-a881-69674937c10a, finger-point gesture) and running around him, essentially orbiting him, in a small circle. This caused the problem to happen in less than a minute. Problems were gone when the person toggled hide/show avatar to trigger a reload of the avatar, but reappeared as soon as we tried to reproduce this issue again. We'll try to get a video of this captured asap and attach a link to it here.",
